          <p>
            A note on those charging times. A standard 120V, 15A household outlet tops out around 1,800W, so headline figures for 4 kWh class units assume a 240V source or several inputs at once. From an ordinary outlet, expect several hours to refill either system. If your plan relies on a gas generator to recharge between outages, read our comparison of <a href="/portable-power-station-vs-generator/">portable power stations and generators</a> to see how the two work together.
