            EcoFlow builds the faster-charging, more expandable and better-integrated home backup units, and its DELTA 3 Max Plus is the strongest 2 kWh package in either lineup. Bluetti builds the lighter 1 kWh box, the longer-rated batteries and the more aggressively priced units, and its Apex 300 offers a 0 ms UPS mode and a modular path to whole-home storage at a lower entry price. Both use LiFePO4 cells rated to the same 80 percent standard, and both offer five-year warranties.
